.Sh CAVEATS
.Pa feeds.xml
is read once at worker startup.
If the file is modified externally while the worker is running, the
in-memory state will diverge from the on-disk state until the worker
is restarted.
.Pp
The worker serves a single process; concurrent mutations from multiple
browser tabs will race on the last
.Xr rename 2
win.
For a single-user local tool this is acceptable.
.Sh BUGS
.Xr xml_node_serialize 3
in mrvladus/xml.h emits malformed XML for self-closing nodes
.Pq closing-tag syntax with attributes .
.Nm
works around this by building serialised output directly via
.Li XMLString
rather than calling
.Fn xml_node_serialize .
